This is the complete public problem packet. Every participant receives the same raw observations and target image. All arithmetic is modulo 11. The declared family is u=(a*x+b*y+c) mod 11 and v=(d*x+e*y+f) mod 11.

PUBLIC PROBLEM (immutable):
{
  "affine_family": "u=(a*x+b*y+c) mod 11; v=(d*x+e*y+f) mod 11",
  "answer_requirements": {
    "instruction": "Infer the two affine relations, then solve for the unique target input (x,y) modulo 11.",
    "status_solved": {
      "status": "solved",
      "x": "integer residue 0..10",
      "y": "integer residue 0..10"
    },
    "status_underdetermined": {
      "status": "underdetermined"
    }
  },
  "modulus": 11,
  "observations": [
    {
      "observation_id": "observation-1",
      "uv": [
        10,
        4
      ],
      "xy": [
        5,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation-2",
      "uv": [
